  "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#semiotic_projection_1",
  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the textual insult",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'a head diaper is required when you have shit for brains' as the object of the hateful projection. The text explicitly attributes the degrading quality to the visual entity (Ms. Omar), and the user, by consuming and interpreting the meme, is positioned as the one who is projecting this insult onto her. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the text, but the act of viewing the meme and the hateful intent of the text create an implicit projection where the user is the one who is 'seeing' or 'imagining' the insult being applied to the target. The projection is onto the textual material, which serves as the vehicle for the hate speech.",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
